{"overview":"Set in a tenement, a lonely confirmed bachelor occupies a room across the hall from a dour spinster. Children run amok in the hallways playing pranks on the two. A little girl from the floor above, now alone in the world, brings the pair together and brightens their lives.","tagline":"A RAY OF HOPE IN THE TENEMENTS OF AN AMERICAN CITY","cast":[{"n":"Ynez Seabury","c":"Little Sunbeam","p":"/mI006v4m6wVemi9R5PUu7iXE7Wl.jpg","q":"Q3572331"},{"n":"Kate Bruce","c":"Sunbeam's Mamma","p":"/oLC99DsB0gkPdsZJRi0d1D1B4hD.jpg","q":"Q2461823"},{"n":"Claire McDowell","c":"The Spinster","p":"/lITEhC4pY2UiqmItzQMBnexxcMU.jpg","q":"Q459580"},{"n":"Dell Henderson","c":"The Bachelor","p":"/gA4BPbRHPSvI16n1QcRlAd3gmSo.jpg","q":"Q3021715"},{"n":"Charles Hill Mailes","c":"The Janitor","p":"/At3GtUXi9WLKero09JGxxVCY6Ph.jpg","q":"Q731452"},{"n":"Priscilla Dean","c":"In Tenement Hallway","p":"/twj8OOwEL8vlkD7h5sF7pFL8gk2.jpg","q":"Q2080415"},{"n":"Gladys Egan","c":"One of the Children in Hallway","p":"/vOTrPoS99wnuACgIOED2vF6FMXv.jpg","q":"Q767742"},{"n":"Edna Foster","c":"Child with Cap in Hallway","p":"/zRoQG1xxn89LIHN9p6zfyJlcdgw.jpg","q":"Q27835182"},{"n":"W. Chrystie Miller","c":"Old Man In Tenement Hallway","p":"/kEDCliujwHUyk8awGehzfybQzzC.jpg","q":"Q2474062"},{"n":"Adolph Lestina","c":"1st Health Inspector","p":"/r7mwL8DBUy7A9MDgRejog9R2TPE.jpg","q":"Q24066913"}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Sunbeam_(1912_film)","qid":"Q3989540"}